#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573224"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573328"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573464"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573508"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573648"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573768"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573868"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574060"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574124"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574204"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574320"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574448"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574492"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574620"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574748"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574856"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574944"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575036"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575184"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575268"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575400"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575500"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575660"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575788"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575880"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576012"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576112"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576320"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576444"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576576"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576668"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576792"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576872"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576976"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577064"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "577184"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "577268"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "577348"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "577416"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "577456"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "577488"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. popupStd
msgctxt "577520"
msgid "Return to the previous floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "577552"
msgid "Return to previous floor."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "577580"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577608"
msgid "There's no doubt about it. There's #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nwho was made into the Labyrinth's #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF like #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nAnd #C236196003Rin#CDEF's former Servant, red #C236196003Lancer#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577824"
msgid "What are we looking at in this room?\nI thought #C236196003Rin#CDEF made it so that the\nTorture Chamber for captured Masters and\nNPCs was done away with―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577984"
msgid "As of chrono-coordinate 2020 07 22,\n64 #RUBS   Masters#RUBEdeserters#REND and 23 discarded NPCs were\nsuccessfully #RUBS   salvaged#RUBEretrieved#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578136"
msgid "We will send them off to the Torture Chamber\nas new patrons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578200"
msgid "Wonderful. You've furnished me with new pigs\nagain. Well done, #C236196003Rani#CDEF. You're a bit of a wet\nblanket, but your work is top-notch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578344"
msgid "Naturally. I complete my contracted work.\nThis is my reason for being; my bliss.\nHowever, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578460"
msgid "Good evening, #[piggy][squirrely]# Master.\nI'm so happy to meet you again. Really!\nI wouldn't flatter you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578568"
msgid "Ho. Glad to meet us again? That's something. But\nI know how you feel. I see that high pride of\nyours can't stand the constant losing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578704"
msgid "Yeah, but I'm getting sick of you. You just\ndon't learn. Why are you here, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF? Looking\nfor new pastures in the companion department?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578860"
msgid "This is a terrible calamity for us.\nPlease don't show this kind of scene to my\nhonest and pure Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578964"
msgid "So you happened to have enough elegance to\ncelebrate our reunion? I see your skull isn't\nfilled with evil dragon muscle, at least."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579096"
msgid "Good answer. Cheeky, impolite, yet so charming.\nSuch valuable prey you are, I'm so lucky that\nyour impudence makes you worth pummeling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579232"
msgid "Even if I was holding back, a loss is a loss.\n#SVT[#C236196003Saber#CDEF][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][#C236196003Caster#CDEF][#C236196003Goldy#CDEF]#. I'll pay you and your Master\nback for that disgrace three, no, sixfold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579452"
msgid "Even if I was holding back, a loss is a loss.\n#SVT[#C236196003Saber#CDEF][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][#C236196003Caster#CDEF][#C236196003Goldy#CDEF]#. I'll pay you and your Master\nback for that disgrace three, no, sixfold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579672"
msgid "Even if I was holding back, a loss is a loss.\n#SVT[#C236196003Saber#CDEF][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][#C236196003Caster#CDEF][#C236196003Goldy#CDEF]#. I'll pay you and your Master\nback for that disgrace three, no, sixfold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579892"
msgid "Even if I was holding back, a loss is a loss.\n#SVT[#C236196003Saber#CDEF][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][#C236196003Caster#CDEF][#C236196003Goldy#CDEF]#. I'll pay you and your Master\nback for that disgrace three, no, sixfold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580112"
msgid "Sixfold, you say!? …hm, we're agreeing more\nand more… Personally, I'm of the opinion that\nthe more spent, the better. But anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580244"
msgid "Do you have anything to back up your claim?\nLuxury and pretense look similar. Beauties who\ntry too hard are cute, but there's a limit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580380"
msgid "Sixfold is a big claim, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF.\nBut aren't you being just as narrow-minded?\nWe saw you at your best in our last fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580516"
msgid "Twofold would be enough, but six, you say?\nMy, what a waste. How are you going to get by\nwith your household's finances like that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580648"
msgid "\"Get by\" is a mindset that reeks of old people.\nIn this era, we go all out with our hospitality.\nMaybe it's our age difference, fox granny?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580788"
msgid "――Got it. Baked lizard coming right up. Now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580836"
msgid "Ho. \"Sixfold\" is yet another big claim.\nI presume you were the lord of some region.\nBut is that all you have in your reserves?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580964"
msgid "Hehe… It looks like you still can't tell how\ndifferent the power balance is when you compare\nyour company to mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581080"
msgid "Behold! My new Torture Chamber! Even when I\nwas alive, I was never able to manage so\nmuch blood!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581180"
msgid "Ah… Why is it so fantastic!? A never-ever-\nending, beautiful spring of living pumps!\nTHIS is what I've wanted: my Salon of Eden!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581312"
msgid "Last time… when #C236196003Rin#CDEF was my attendant,\nI wasn't able to manifest my true power."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581408"
msgid "But this time it's different. Thanks to #C236196003Rani#CDEF's\nperfect mana supply, I've become my true\nself again!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581524"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF speaks with elation.\n…certainly, the strong pressure she's emanating\nis greater than before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581644"
msgid "The real issue isn't with the powered-up #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, though.\nThe opening of a new Torture Chamber is\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581788"
msgid "I don't remember exactly, but #C236196003Rani#CDEF wasn't\nthat sort of inhuman girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581876"
msgid "She's a homunculus… an artificial being created on Earth.\nSimilar in some ways to the electronic lives of AI,\nbut different in others. Her life was manufactured,\nbut a fragment of it is \"human.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582072"
msgid "There's no more doubt about that."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "582108"
msgid "Sorry for the wait, Rani!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "582136"
msgid "You're really not wearing any, Rani!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582176"
msgid "…what a peculiar thing to say. I am sane.\nIf anyone is being abnormal, it's you all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582264"
msgid "I don't understand what you mean, but there's\nno need for you to apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI'm not particularly angry about anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582408"
msgid "This is the second time you've made\na thoughtless remark. Let's just say that\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's objective and mine are one and the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582548"
msgid "I'm the #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF who the Labyrinth was entrusted\nto. This you should already have known.\nYou and I are enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582676"
msgid "And knowing that, you still stepped into the\nLabyrinth? Perhaps, you wish to open\ndiscussions or similar?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582784"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's words cause me great pain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582836"
msgid "…I already experienced with #C236196003Rin#CDEF how we\nwon't be able to talk things through.\nI don't expect things to be that easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582972"
msgid "It's just, apart from that, #C236196003Rani#CDEF's tone hurt me.\nShe hasn't changed at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583064"
msgid "I may have forgotten most of the things I knew\nabout her, but I feel like she's the type of friend that's\nhard to come by. I'm surprised to learn that she's\nlike this―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583240"
msgid "…you haven't come looking to battle, right?\nThen please go back.\nI don't have time to spare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583336"
msgid "I may be the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF,\nbut it's also my duty to develop #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583468"
msgid "You're wrong. I'm acting as #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's producer\nto make her a first-class idol.\nThat was the condition of our contract."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583604"
msgid "In order to do that, I was looking up data\non the past #C000246204Holy Grail Wars#CDEF that occurred\nin the Near Side of the Moon…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583736"
msgid "I'm temporarily securing the defeated and\ndeleted Masters and extracting their resources."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583828"
msgid "That's horrible… Then, aren't these the people\nwho were dragged in by #C236196003BB#CDEF!? These humans\nwere actually alive…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583960"
msgid "Do you think this is inhumane? One second later,\nand they would've been deleted by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nTheir destiny is to be defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584108"
msgid "They're briefly held in an Imaginary Number\nSpace, and their quasi-Spiritrons… the relevant\npart of their blood, is harvested. No harm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584248"
msgid "They're originally deleted beings. If #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nlikes, she can lock them in this prison and\nprolong their lives for a momentary eternity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584400"
msgid "I will ask you once more.\n―――Are there any problems with my actions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584472"
msgid "…pressured by #C236196003Rani#CDEF's calm eyes, words don't come out of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584552"
msgid "If I were asked if this goes against everything humane,\nthere's not a doubt in my mind that it does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584656"
msgid "But――what do the Masters who were brought\nto this Torture Chamber really think?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584740"
msgid "For example: they're criminals on the\nguillotine, which mercilessly falls,\nand they're a second away from death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584856"
msgid "That kinda human rights violation has nothing to\ndo with this! Even #C236196003Leo#CDEF's Western European\nconglomerate must hear stuff like that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585004"
msgid "Hey, we're a little better than that. Our\nemployees have the freedom to choose manual\nlabor or studies. The benefits are good, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585136"
msgid "More importantly, what about the old man!?\nWhere's old man #C236196003Gatou#CDEF!? Did you already hang\nhim up in the Torture Chamber!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585272"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF? Ah, that big man from before.\nA boar like him might get muscle in my blood.\nNo thanks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585384"
msgid "It seems that #C236196003Rani#CDEF dealt with him…\nWhat did you do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585456"
msgid "I didn't feel like disposing of him\nor educating him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585512"
msgid "He's a contaminant with negative Prince\nStrength. Since he's a pain, I quarantined him\nin a corner of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585632"
msgid "If you leave him alone like he is for ten\nyears, then he might become a cleaner #C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585736"
msgid "Ah. That's the \"Prince Grading\" you're so good\nat. You ignore Masters without promise, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585832"
msgid "Sure. According to my glasses' measurements…\n#[His][Her]# Protagonist Power is only five…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585924"
msgid "Total trash.\nThen should we clean things up here nice\nand tidy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585988"
msgid "…however, with some polish, #[his][her]# great talent\nwill shine. No, I will make #[him][her]# shine. I have\nto bring it out, no matter what."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586132"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's glasses shine with a flash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586184"
msgid "Some intense, unpleasant premonition rushes\nthrough my entire body―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586260"
msgid "I've decided. We're enacting Plan D.\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF, please send us back for the moment.\nI'm going to remake this layer to my liking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586404"
msgid "Okay. I'll do as you say, producer. In exchange,\nhurry and prepare my personal stage and\nthousand-#ROFS-002#RUBS  slave#RUBEmember#REND fanclub."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586552"
msgid "Stop… is what I want to say, but let's\npull back, too. As long as this Shield is here,\nthere's no going forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586668"
msgid "Wai―stop, you four-eyed Indian! A Protagonist\nPower of five? Those glasses only see the bad\nbecause they're so damn foggy! For sure!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586804"
msgid "Look like they scurried back home. …hmm.\nOur enemy this time is also a woman. Mongrel.\nYour escape drama is too unbalanced."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586932"
msgid "…#C236196003Rani#CDEF and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF ended up transporting\nthemselves somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587028"
msgid "Since the ruler of this Labyrinth is #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nwe have no means of chasing after her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587128"
msgid "We confirmed that #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is still alive.\nLet's try heading back to the old school for\na bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587236"
msgid "I'm inside a deep ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587264"
msgid "I vaguely remember the ambiance of this floor\nas being similar to the Near Side #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's Arena."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587384"
msgid "There's just one big difference between this\nand the Arena. A chant echoes through the\nLabyrinth, like ripples on water."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587508"
msgid "If I were to close my eyes and strain my ears,\nthat alone would clear my mind.\nIt's that sort of beautiful voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587624"
msgid "This singing is so beautiful, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587664"
msgid "Perhaps it's the sound of the wind. Certainly,\nit makes me a little sluggish, but it worries me\nnot. Gods, you are quite high strung."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587800"
msgid "How can one expect any less from the\nself-proclaimed artist who is loved by the goddess\nof art. From her perspective, this beautiful\nchanting needs a lot of work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587964"
msgid "…this voice… Yeah, it's her.\nHer personality stinks, but I have to concede\nthat her voice, at least, is lovely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588080"
msgid "There's some truth to #C236196003Archer#CDEF's words.\nLike he said, this chanting is beautiful and chaste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588188"
msgid "Ho. A good, aesthetic voice. That #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. She's\na dragon girl, albeit diluted. She\nhas lungs and a throat humans can't obtain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588332"
msgid "Being able to control such a wide and high scale\nas this makes her quite the singer.\nI will have to re-evaluate her now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588456"
msgid "Anyhow, this Labyrinth is now under\n#C236196003BB#CDEF and her entourages' control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588540"
msgid "I'm worried about the new #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF, but I'm also\nworried about #C236196003Gatou#CDEF's safety, since he sent us that SOS."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588680"
msgid "The moment #C236196003#SVT#CDEF gave me a glance to signal\nthat I should steel myself and march on, a call rang out\nfrom my terminal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588816"
msgid "Can you hear me, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF? This is the\nStudent Council Room. Our monitors and scans are \nboth keeping levels normal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588948"
msgid "Well done, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. I hate to keep burdening\nyou, but please keep the Student Council Room\nSub-Engine going."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589072"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Since #C236196003Gatou#CDEF's distress signal\nhas ceased, for the time being,\nplease try moving forward as far as you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589220"
msgid "Since this is a new layer, please take extra\ncare when fighting. If you feel like you're in\ndanger, return back through the stairs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589352"
msgid "I'm picking up readings on old man #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, so\nthere's no need to panic. That old man won't go\ndown no matter how much you kick his bucket."
msgstr ""

